msgid ""
"A widget factory is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it "
"under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the free "
"software foundation, either version 3 of the license, or (at your option) "
"any later version."
msgstr ""
"La fabrique à widgets est un logiciel libre ; vous pouvez le redistribuer et/"
